[TITLE]
SIM-21: GPV V1 between J1 and J2, with three head loss curves to choose from
At 100 gpm, curve C1 gives 5 ft, C2 gives 20 ft and C3 gives 80 ft. V1 uses C2.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     0
 J2   0     0
 J3   0     100

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   200

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J2  J3  1000    12    100    0      Open

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting
 V1  J1  J2  12    GPV   C2

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow (gpm)  HeadLoss (ft)
 C1  0           0
 C1  100         5
 C2  0           0
 C2  100         20
 C3  0           0
 C3  100         80

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
